## Severity Classification

Classify the severity using the following scale:

| Level    | Meaning |
|----------|---------|
| CRITICAL | Causes data loss, security breach, or system crash in production. |
| HIGH     | Major functionality broken; likely to affect many users. |
| MEDIUM   | Partial functionality affected; workaround exists. |
| LOW      | Minor cosmetic or style issue; does not affect functionality. |
| INFO     | Suggestion or improvement, no defect. |

